(a) It shall be unlawful for the occupant of any lot of land or premises in the county, or the owner of any lot of land or premises in the county, or any agent or representative of such owner or occupant, to permit or maintain on such lot any nuisance as enumerated herein, the accumulation of debris or the harborage of inoperable motor vehicles, as defined in this article, which distracts from the community aesthetics, and endangers the public health, safety or welfare.
